        "description2": "A clevis is only as strong as its forging. In towing, lifting, agricultural, and construction applications, the clevis pin and bracket assembly is a critical load-bearing joint \u2014 it must withstand dynamic shock loads, side loading, and corrosive environments without permanent deformation or brittle fracture. JK Forge manufactures clevis forgings and complete rigging hardware sets using closed-die forging processes in EN8, EN24, SS 304, and SS 316, producing components with the grain flow continuity and dimensional precision that safety-critical applications demand.",
