                "title": "Eye Bolts & Eye Nuts",
                "desc": "Forged eye bolts in Grade 4 and Grade 8 in metric sizes M12 to M64. Swivel eye bolts, shoulder pattern eye bolts, and collar eye bolts produced to DIN 580 and BS 4278. Eye bolts forged with integral head \u2014 the eye is not welded on \u2014 ensuring full strength under angular loading of up to 45 degrees from vertical."
