                "title": "Grade 36, 55 and 105 Material Options",
                "desc": "Material grade selection spanning standard ductile Grade 36 carbon steel through higher-strength Grade 55 and Grade 105 options, matched to the foundation's design tension and, where applicable, seismic or wind-load supplementary requirements."
