                "desc": "Agricultural tractor tie rods operate in mud, dust and high-cyclic shock loading environments. We forge tractor tie rod bodies and end forgings in EN8 and EN19T to tractor OEM drawings, with aggressive taper shank designs and large ball housing sections that accommodate articulated steering loads on heavy tractors above 50 HP."
