                "question": "Can you supply sprocket blanks for automotive timing applications?",
                "answer": "Yes. Forged sprocket blanks for automotive timing chain applications, including crankshaft and camshaft timing sprockets, machined to the dimensional precision and fatigue resistance engine timing components require across the engine's full service life."
