                "question": "What gear blank types does JK Forge manufacture?",
                "answer": "We forge spur gear blanks, helical gear blanks, bevel gear blanks (straight and spiral), ring gear blanks, planetary gear blanks, sun gear blanks, cluster gear blanks and gear shaft blanks. OD range 50\u20131200 mm. All types can be supplied with or without a forged bore depending on the blank size and customer requirement."
